    player "[valerie]因为你们被解雇了..."

# game/scripts/Locations/company.rpy:3078
translate chinese_simp company_second_aftermath_72fb1cd6:

    # nova "That was never the goal."
    nova "那从来不是我们的本意。"

# game/scripts/Locations/company.rpy:3079
translate chinese_simp company_second_aftermath_429c0b80:

    # player "But you knew [sophia] would blame her."
    player "但你们知道[sophia]会怪到她头上。"

# game/scripts/Locations/company.rpy:3080
translate chinese_simp company_second_aftermath_ba33a16e:

    # nova "We knew it was possible."
    nova "我们知道有这种可能。"

# game/scripts/Locations/company.rpy:3083
translate chinese_simp company_second_aftermath_1597b5c9:

    # nova "We also knew [valerie] was already in danger staying there."
    nova "我们也知道[valerie]留在那里本来就处于危险之中。"

# game/scripts/Locations/company.rpy:3084
translate chinese_simp company_second_aftermath_67352b1d:

    # kora "She's safer not working there."
    kora "不在那里工作她反而更安全。"

# game/scripts/Locations/company.rpy:3085
translate chinese_simp company_second_aftermath_8d6aa624:

    # player "That's not really your choice to make."
    player "这不是你们能替她做的决定。"

# game/scripts/Locations/company.rpy:3086
translate chinese_simp company_second_aftermath_e9fbd107:

    # player "What did you even do this time?"
    player "你们这次到底做了什么？"

# game/scripts/Locations/company.rpy:3089
translate chinese_simp company_second_aftermath_c747127e:

    # kora "Once the cameras were clear, I walked in."
    kora "监控那边没问题了之后，我就进去了。"

# game/scripts/Locations/company.rpy:3090
translate chinese_simp company_second_aftermath_1a7a9842:

    # kora "[valerie] was the only one watching that floor closely."
    kora "[valerie]是唯一一个紧盯着那层楼的人。"

# game/scripts/Locations/company.rpy:3091
translate chinese_simp company_second_aftermath_36698d19:

    # player "I get that."
    player "这我明白。"

# game/scripts/Locations/company.rpy:3094
